    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "method",
      "heading": "Method",
      "chunks": [
        {
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c1_rawm_starts_orthogonal_projector_owm",
          "text": "RAWM starts from the orthogonal projector P of OWM, which points the update away from the subspace spanned by previous inputs. On top of it, the method builds a second projector Q that is orthogonal to P and scaled by the ratio beta of genuine to fake utterances in the batch.",
